{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/8a21d999b5ff58b6ff19ec58d1ca5fab.avif?t=1758318812\" width=916 height=214 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/a32acb40a7664b11fa82c1ead28da4b0.avif?t=1758318812\" width=620 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing after her assailant, Tashia discovers a bustling market, hidden under a sprawling cotton tree, the Halfway Market. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly realizing that she has lost much more than a cell phone. Tashia is distraught to discover that somehow she's become enmeshed in a murder mystery (and that somehow she has lost her shadow). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must now find the culprit among the ghostly denizens of the market, learning about their lives before the market, as well as their untimely deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/7f7bf9abc927dbd3f99af4cee5b06363.avif?t=1758318812\" width=620 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Hidden World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a beautiful world that blends the magical with the mundane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the various vending stalls as you conduct your investigation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit each location at different times throughout the day as the suspects move about.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Halfway Market!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical place populated by Duppy, mischievous spirits who trick and teach in equal measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>clues</strong>, uncover mysterious <strong>motives</strong> and confirm which suspect has the <strong>means</strong> to conduct this heinous caper! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the Mystery! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate 7 suspects based on creatures of Myth &amp; Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross reference statements based on the facts you've gathered and deduce the culprit responsible! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1958800?t=1758318812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758318812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/9f8e8029b3d804c51a4acd2795dde950f0b6b520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758318812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/9f8e8029b3d804c51a4acd2795dde950f0b6b520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758318812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/8a21d999b5ff58b6ff19ec58d1ca5fab.avif?t=1758318812\" width=916 height=214 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/a32acb40a7664b11fa82c1ead28da4b0.avif?t=1758318812\" width=620 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing after her assailant, Tashia discovers a bustling market, hidden under a sprawling cotton tree, the Halfway Market. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly realizing that she has lost much more than a cell phone. Tashia is distraught to discover that somehow she's become enmeshed in a murder mystery (and that somehow she has lost her shadow). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She must now find the culprit among the ghostly denizens of the market, learning about their lives before the market, as well as their untimely deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/extras/7f7bf9abc927dbd3f99af4cee5b06363.avif?t=1758318812\" width=620 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Hidden World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a beautiful world that blends the magical with the mundane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the various vending stalls as you conduct your investigation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit each location at different times throughout the day as the suspects move about.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate the Halfway Market!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical place populated by Duppy, mischievous spirits who trick and teach in equal measure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>clues</strong>, uncover mysterious <strong>motives</strong> and confirm which suspect has the <strong>means</strong> to conduct this heinous caper! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the Mystery! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate 7 suspects based on creatures of Myth &amp; Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross reference statements based on the facts you've gathered and deduce the culprit responsible! </p>","developers":["Spritewrench"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958800/da5632ee36dbfbc702a4cd0f8bb9d62683a146b7/header.jpg?t=1758318812","is_